ORDINANCE - Pursuant to Sections 1.1.6 and 2.4.1(b) of the Cheyenne Unified
Development Code (UDC), Amending Article 6,  Design Regulations, Section 6.5.8, Billboards, for
the purpose of establishing which zoning districts allow billboards -- referred to Public Services
