CHARTER ORDINANCE - Establishing the position of City Administrator and exempting
the City of Cheyenne, as a First Class City, from certain sections of the Wyoming Statutes -- referred
to Committee of the Whole (sponsors - Mr. Cook, Mr. Luna, Mr. Roybal, Mr. Shanor, Ms.
Williams).  Under other business, it was noted that, due to the City’s schedule during Cheyenne
Frontier Days, the Committee of the Whole meeting would be held Tuesday, July 21, 2015 at 6:00
p.m. in City Council Chambers.
RESOLUTION - Authorizing the Mayor and the City Clerk to sign a Final Plat for Waterford
